OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin crop exceeds growers'
OL,4,Aexpectations
OL,5,
OL,6,FPumpkin growers in Sussex say they have
OL,7,Fproduced a strong Halloween harvest
OL,8,Fdespite the UK's hottest summer on
OL,9,Frecord.
OL,11,FFarms in Sompting near Lancing and Rye
OL,12,Fare welcoming visitors picking pumpkins
OL,13,Fin the run-up to Halloween.
OL,15,FAt Sompting Pumpkins, tenant farmer
OL,16,FCaroline Harriott said growers had been
OL,17,Fconcerned repeated heatwaves would
OL,18,Faffect the crop.
OL,20,FShe said the farm's pumpkins had
OL,21,F"exceeded all our expectations" despite
OL,22,Fthe challenging growing conditions.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
